# Frontend Project Index

Generated: 2026-09-11
Scope: `frontend/`

This index is intended to help future AI/code work avoid repeatedly traversing the frontend tree.

## Project Summary

- App type: Vue 3 single-page application built with Vite.
- UI library: Element Plus with `@element-plus/icons-vue`.
- HTTP client: Axios.
- Domain: travel planning map app with login, trips, places, routes, Baidu Map markers, route lines, and Baidu navigation links.
- Main source entry: `frontend/src/main.js`
- Main app component: `frontend/src/App.vue`
- Map component: `frontend/src/components/MapView.vue`
- Runtime config source: `frontend/app.config.json`, exposed to client by `frontend/vite.config.js` as `__APP_CONFIG__`.

